    <unit id="=&gt;a26" name="=&gt;a26">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">52</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Where are you people from?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Звідки ви, люди?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q27" name="=&gt;q27">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">54</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>West. Southwest, actually. It's a long story.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">З заходу. Південно-захід, насправді. Це довга історія.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q28" name="=&gt;q28">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">56</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>There was this... war... and, you know, some of us had to move away and... 

It's a long story, bre.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Була така... війна... і, знаєш, деяким з нас довелося переїхати і...

Це довга історія, брате.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q29" name="=&gt;q29">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">58</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>We're here now. ::He nods.:: We're here.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми тут зараз. ::Він киває.:: Ми тут.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a30" name="=&gt;a30">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">60</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Goodbye and take care.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">До побачення і бережи себе.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q31" name="=&gt;q31">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">62</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>One moment: Eh, that uniform... where'd you get it?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Зачекай: Ех, ця форма... де ти її взяв?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a32" name="=&gt;a32">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">64</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::[Tailoring]:: I made it myself, actually. Saw the design somewhere and fell in love with it.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::[Пошиття]:: Я зробив її сам, насправді. Десь побачив дизайн і закохався в нього.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q33" name="=&gt;q33">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">66</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Hardcore, bre! It does look... *authentic*. &lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Круто, брате! Вона виглядає... *автентично*. &lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a34" name="=&gt;a34">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">68</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Sure does. Any particular reason why you're asking?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Звісно. Чи є якась конкретна причина, чому ви запитуєте?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q35" name="=&gt;q35">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">70</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>No reason, bre. Just asking... 

...just asking. Bye.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Немає причини, друже. Просто запитую...

...просто запитую. Бувай.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a36" name="=&gt;a36">
